if\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-50+)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Holy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Holy_Damage_Icon_dc372b.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Divine Missile</span> (65-180+)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Fast Self-Healing</span> (10-200)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Summons</span> (1-3 <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolf</a>)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Shapeshifting\"><img alt=\"Shapeshifting\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellwand_Icon_f4c7a5.png\" width=\"12\"/></span></span></span> Shapeshifting</span> (Turns  into; <a href=\"#/wiki/War%20Wolf\">War Wolf</a>)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Mana Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mana_Drain_Icon_a3e6f8.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Mana Drain</span> (20-45+)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div cla